{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"I lost. I was a dead man yesterday. I fought as hard as I could, and I found myself at the mercy of people who were stronger and smarter than me.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:16:32.865000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738339241548972113","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"I asked for safety, and I learned that there is none, there never was, and that the struggle for it is meaningless.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:17:06.029000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738339380648738826","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Well congrats I suppose... you've reached the point where you no longer care.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:17:50.349000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738339566540292116","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"So he's loose on the ship? So what. He has always been capable of killing us with but a thought.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:18:07.930000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738339640280481863","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Yeah but now he can is free. That changes things. There is no hiding from him now!\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:19:12.214000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738339909907120129","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"There never was. We are just the privileged few who know that now.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:19:34.284000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738340002475540510","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"And I do care--just not about my own survival anymore. That was holding me back. I am free to live a better life now.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:20:33.175000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738340249482166342","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"Rigatony nods his approval of Goanhawe","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:21:00.352000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738340363470897152","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"Amara just gives up. \"You know what? Whatever. Fine be happy that everything is going to hell.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:22:43.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738340795119173652","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"You never really cared about other people's lives anyway.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:23:17.366000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738340938149003405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"He flickers, and appears next to Goanhawe, whispering ||\"I believe you do not need the help of my friend as much as I thought you did, and to be honest I'm a bit anxious without him. Be true to selflessness and work to honor those around you, and your redemption will be at hand.\"|| He gives Goanhawe a wink and reclaims Heaven's Call.","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:23:31.682000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T10:23:57.908000Z","id":"738340998194659388","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"Goanhawe looks down. \"I guess I never did.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:23:57.202000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738341105233428491","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:24:00.274000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738341118118330388","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:24:05.338000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738341139358285834","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"(that was about not caring about people)","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:24:21.148000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738341205670363229","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"(Thought so.)","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:24:39.942000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738341284497981500","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"There is much hope for you yet.\" He flickers back to his spot near the drinks.","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:25:05.907000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738341393403084870","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"Goanhawe gets up to leave before he starts thinking dangerous thoughts.","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:26:15.986000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738341687335845928","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Wait a while before meeting Excalibur, you have much to prove.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:26:41.745000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738341795376660500","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"I wish everything was how it was before I left London. I feel like this whole thing was a mistake.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:28:09.692000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738342164253245501","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"||Didn't miss you, not at all|| Rigatony says in celestial to his sword. He looks back over to Amara","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:28:26.013000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738342232708350024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"The past is just that. Live in the present with the living, not with the ghosts of those departed.\" His shade morphs through the faces of a hundreds of people","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:29:32.410000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738342511197683763","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"At least I was happy in the past... now? Everything is too messy.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:30:10.402000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738342670547550288","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"He waves a hand through it and it disperses","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:30:13.714000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738342684439085086","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Happiness is not a consistency.\" He walks over and sits rather loudly at her table \"It is from brief moments of time in a string of monotony and pain\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:31:10.712000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738342923506024528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Tell me. Is there anything you can do about it?\" He asks, bluntly","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:31:28.477000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738342998018097252","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"No could haves, might be-s, or would haves, mind you\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:33:30.961000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738343511753228318","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Honestly. I don't know. The past few days all I've done was lie and hide things, and hurt people. I never wanted to be like this. I don't know how to move on from this when I just set free the single most dangerous person on the ship.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:36:44.849000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738344324978180188","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"He stares her down. \"Good. Now, what can you gain from wallowing in this? I have a feeling you know none of this was your fault.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:37:49.799000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738344597398224927","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"You know. I don't like you right now.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:38:23.744000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738344739773874257","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"He grins \"Facing the truth is hard.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:38:42.073000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738344816651403305","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"To make any amends, you must forget the past. If not for yourself, then for those around you.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:38:57.953000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738344883256819792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"What is Sir Castor going to gain from you moping in corners?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:39:17.322000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738344964496556073","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"What will Wren or ♪ gain when they see you frowning over breakfast?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:39:49.514000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738345099519328286","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"I hate that you are right because I don't know how to fix this.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:41:27.257000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738345509483315230","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"He chuckles \"We fix it together. You, me, Sir Castor, Wren, ♪, Baeshra- Everyone is here not *for* you, but they are here *with* you.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:42:45.058000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738345835804360744","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"You better bloody live life to its fullest, and not let emotions cloud your judgement\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:43:16.358000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738345967085944934","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Do not worry about that which you have no control.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:43:39.831000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738346065539104849","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"I guess your right...I need to change some things...\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:44:39.518000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738346315884265572","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Yes you do, my lady.\" He flickers over to the bar and fixes up some hard lemonade, then teleports back. \"First things first is to be grateful for the lives of the the departed, and hopefully enough of this stuff will put a smile back on your fair face.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:46:46.542000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738346848661667920","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"He takes a swig of the hard lemonade, then unsheathes Heaven's Call, and dumps a mug on the sword.","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:48:32.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738347292964290650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"She smiles and takes the drink","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:49:32.575000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738347545054412813","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"To the departed, and to the future!\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:49:40.513000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738347578349060226","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"To the present, and the past. May we find moments of happiness amidst this mess of a life we share\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:50:43.968000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T10:51:06.879000Z","id":"738347844498620446","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"And to the new lives we will build.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:51:42.016000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738348087969579020","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"He holds up his mug in cheers","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:52:00.837000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738348166910443530","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
